### 상품 목록
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### 주문 생성 (회원 4번)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-MEMBER-ID: 4

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 },
    { "productId": 3, "quantity": 2 }
  ],
  "usePoint": 0,
  "receiverName": "최수아",
  "receiverPhone": "010-4444-5555",
  "address": "서울시 강남구 테헤란로 123",
  "memo": "문 앞에 놓아주세요"
}

### 결제
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 304,
  "method": "CARD",
  "cardNo": "1234-5678-9012-3456"
}

### 내 주문 목록
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders
X-MEMBER-ID: 4

### 주문 취소
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/304/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
X-MEMBER-ID: 4

{
  "reason": "단순 변심"
}

### 관리자 - 주문 검색
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/orders/search?status=PAID

### 관리자 - 월별 매출
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/stats/monthly?year=2026&month=11

### 내 포인트 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/members/me/point
X-MEMBER-ID: 4
